{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/wanna_buy_a_game_kiddo.png?t=1750813278\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You are a rat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/you_a_rat_bg.gif?t=1750813278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smell trash, play with flies and eat cheese. Roleplay as the infamous <strong>generic rat</strong> and take on a huge journey through your home sewers with <strong>substantially wacky </strong>encounters, <strong>weird puzzles</strong> and <strong>extremely subtle, often unfunny jokes</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/rotate.gif?t=1750813278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have only one type of move - rotating the 6 hexes around the tile you click on. Use it to overcome a variety of challenges, avoid traps and slay your enemies. The game features quite a big set of mechanics - deadly enemies, weapons and items, mechanical contraptions and many, many more...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Genre-bending</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/gameplay2.gif?t=1750813278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inconceivable Rat Endeavour</strong> is mainly a puzzle game. However, it borrows handsomely from other genres and sprinkles it on top of the core mechanics, achieving unique, unconventional and  <strong>silly</strong> gameplay. Match-3, rhythm games, farming sim, or even a full-blown text adventure..? The game takes you on an <strong>endeavour</strong>, where you'll constantly see new things and travel forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/best_game_evur.png?t=1750813278\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Travel the sewers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/3biomes.png?t=1750813278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit multiple sewer-stylized, pixelart biomes as you progress. Complete plethora of hand-crafted levels arranged into a linear campaign - a continuous adventure. Dive deeper into new mechanics with level branches that present harder challenges puzzle-wise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find legendary infinite cheese</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/big_cheese.png?t=1750813278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eat cheese, smell cheese, gamble cheese, harvest cheese, sell and buy cheese... Do what it takes to finish your quest and find <strong>infinite cheese</strong> that the legends foretold (just a regular cheese, but very big) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...well, you're a rat, what more would you ask for?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">at least one rat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">exactly 23 types of cheese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">it's literally a game about a rat</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3338180?t=1750813278","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3338180?t=1750813278","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/158d20fba0ab92a050f5e6081969b6a36c5b3657/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750813278","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/158d20fba0ab92a050f5e6081969b6a36c5b3657/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750813278","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3492820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/wanna_buy_a_game_kiddo.png?t=1750813278\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You are a rat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/you_a_rat_bg.gif?t=1750813278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smell trash, play with flies and eat cheese. Roleplay as the infamous <strong>generic rat</strong> and take on a huge journey through your home sewers with <strong>substantially wacky </strong>encounters, <strong>weird puzzles</strong> and <strong>extremely subtle, often unfunny jokes</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/rotate.gif?t=1750813278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have only one type of move - rotating the 6 hexes around the tile you click on. Use it to overcome a variety of challenges, avoid traps and slay your enemies. The game features quite a big set of mechanics - deadly enemies, weapons and items, mechanical contraptions and many, many more...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Genre-bending</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/gameplay2.gif?t=1750813278\" /></div></p>