 literally a game about a rat</p></li></ul>","developers":["Seven Rats"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/9e66b950a2ea7fc8eb0fc3d883fd703afb106773/header.jpg?t=1750813278","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Compatible with Vulkan 1.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 196 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257081849,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257081849/movie480.mp4?t=1739636479","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257081849/movie_max.mp4?t=1739636479"},"name":"Demo trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257081849/9f53e2435b715b0c1447e48e1aeec64443c43e4b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739636479","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257081849/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739636479","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257081849/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739636479"}}],"name":"Inconceivable Rat Endeavour","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Compatible with Vulkan 1.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 196 MB available space</li></ul>","rec